sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant M as FeedbackManager
    participant P as Redaction · Correlator · Provenance
    participant S as FeedbackStore
    participant D as Subscribers & streams
    participant R as Router & handlers
    participant O as Observability sink

    App->>M: submit(source, category, target, payload, ...)
    Note over M: validate input
    M->>P: redact, correlate, resolve provenance
    Note over P: correlation and provenance failures<br/>follow the FailurePolicy
    M->>S: create(event as RECEIVED)
    alt idempotency key already stored
        S-->>M: original event
        M-->>App: original event, not processed again
    else new feedback
        S-->>M: stored event
        M-)O: feedback.received
        M->>D: publish
        M->>R: route, then run each handler
        M-)O: feedback.routed
        M-->>App: stored event
    end
